cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite MARIDA for the training data."
type: software
title: "mdebris: sargassum and marine debris detection on Sentinel-2 imagery"
abstract: >-
  An open Python pipeline and a per-pixel spectral classifier trained on the
  MARIDA benchmark. It reads free Sentinel-2 L2A imagery over HTTP, calls each
  sea pixel sargassum, uncertain or clear with a calibrated probability, and
  rolls the result onto named stretches of coast with per-pass observability.
authors:
